Something to the tune of: (Very quick, please correct) gets the spirit of All Your Base.

Alpha are I and the Omega,
are first and last,
the Beginning am and the End.
?
?
?
*I don't know if I should try to keep the...odd grammar of this poem or find the accurate one and translate that...

CAPTAIN: What happen?
    .i ma fasnu

COMPUTER: This is an emergency, Level 3 alert.
    ????
*you can't point at an emergency?

CREWMEMBER 1: Somebody set up us the bomb.
    .i zo'e dunda mi'o le jbama

CAPTAIN: Take off every "Zig." You know what you doing.
    .i ko renro ro la .zig. .i do djuno le nu do gasnu

CREWMEMBER 2: Roger!
    .i je'e

CREWMEMBER 1: We get signal!
    .i ma'a terbe'i le sinxa

CAPTAIN: (in shock) What!
    .i ke'o

CATS: ALL YOUR BASE ARE BELONG TO US
    .i ro ledo dinju bilni cu tutra mi'a

CATS: YOU HAVE NO CHANCE TO SURVIVE MAKE YOUR TIME. HA HA HA!!
    .i do ponse la no ni lakne renvi .i zbasu la do temci

CAPTAIN: (staring at screen in horror) What you say!!
    .i ma selba'u do

CREWMEMBER 2: Captain!
    .i doi jatna

CAPTAIN: (slowly, with great deliberation) ...Move "Zig." For great justice!
    .i tu'a ko rinka le nu ro la .zig. muvdu


I stole the script off of [http://www.everything2.com/index.pl?node=ALL%20YOUR%20BASE%20ARE%20BELONG%20TO%20US|everything2] and edited out most everything that isn't dialogue.
